# Lyra Reader 0.4 Release Notes

This release expands browser-aware fetching and adds more document adapters.

## Added

- Browser snapshot input with selected element metadata.
- Query-focused fit markdown for research workflows.

## Fixed

- Improved chunk source ranges for long markdown documents.
- More stable warnings for SPA shell pages.
